      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "If the numbers are \\(x\\) and \\(y,\\) then \\[ \\frac1x+\\frac1y =\\frac{x+y}{xy} =\\frac{10}{20} =\\frac12. \\]\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is B.",
